@title EPISODE 16 • FAKE DATE, REAL FEELINGS
@bg gala_ballroom_night
@show alana
Cam's mother's gala. Alana in borrowed Sterling diamonds, because you insisted.
Alana: This is a mistake. I can't do small talk. I can only do intervals.
London: Pretend small talk is a 400. Fast, painful, over.
Cam walks up in a navy suit and actually stops walking when he sees her.
Cam: ...Hi.
Alana: Hi.
Neither of them says anything else for an embarrassingly long time.
> [Bold] Push them toward the dance floor. -> g1
> [Good] Leave them alone. Find the dessert table. -> g2
> [Bitchy] "Okay, this is painful. Somebody say a word." -> g3
*g1
@add Alana_Cam 2
@add Alana_Friendship 1
They dance like two people who've only ever moved at race pace. It's terrible. They're laughing by the end.
@jump g_done
*g2
@add Alana_Cam 3
From across the room you watch Cam say something that makes Alana throw her head back laughing. That is not fake.
@jump g_done
*g3
@add Alana_Friendship -1
@add Alana_Cam 1
Cam: (laughing) She's right. Hi, Alana. You look... wow.
*g_done
@show diggy
You didn't know Diggy was coming. Cam invited half both teams to make the ex jealous. Diggy's in the same too-short blazer, now with a tie.
Diggy: You look—
London: I know.
Diggy: I was gonna say "cold." You want my jacket?
> [Sweet] Take it. Keep it the whole night. -> j1
> [Bitchy] "It wouldn't match." -> j2
> [Bold] "I want you to ask me to dance." -> j3
*j1
@add Diggy_Affection 3
It smells like cedar and cheap cologne. You will never give it back.
@jump j_done
*j2
@add Diggy_Affection 1
Diggy: (draping it on you anyway) Fashion is temporary. Hypothermia is forever.
@jump j_done
*j3
@add Diggy_Affection 4
@add Diggy_Trust 1
He holds out his hand. Slow song. He counts the steps under his breath like it's a block start. It's the most romantic thing that has ever happened to you.
*j_done
